; Disposable WB 3.1 Execute .DEF probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 21
Echo "BEGIN" >RAM:execute-capture
Echo ".KEY filename" >RAM:execute-probe
Echo ".DEF filename fallback" >>RAM:execute-probe
Echo "Echo <filename> >RAM:execute-capture" >>RAM:execute-probe
C:Execute RAM:execute-probe
Echo "END" >>RAM:execute-capture
Copy RAM:execute-capture S:Shell-Startup >NIL:
EndCLI >NIL:
